      "id": "ballerina_multimodel",
      "title": "Beyond text: Multimodal AI at your fingertips",
      "descriptionHtml": "<p>AI isn’t just about text—and neither is Ballerina. With connectors to popular AI providers, you can integrate image generation, audio synthesis, and other multimodal capabilities into your applications. Whatever the medium, Ballerina helps you bring it all together through a unified, type-safe integration layer.</p>\n",
